✅ PART 1: Linux / OS Commands (Foundation – MUST KNOW)

These are non-negotiable for any Cloud Engineer.

🔹 File & Directory
ls        # list files
pwd       # present working directory
cd        # change directory
mkdir     # create directory
rm -rf    # delete files/directories
cp        # copy files
mv        # move/rename files
🔹 File Viewing & Editing
cat
less
more
head
tail -f
vi / nano
🔹 Permissions & Ownership
chmod
chown
chgrp
🔹 System Monitoring
top
htop
df -h
free -m
uptime
whoami
